44
00:01:38,820 --> 00:01:48,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>It's the truth! Now more than ever, Adventure!</i></font>

45
00:01:51,340 --> 00:01:55,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">"The Identity of the Masked Man"</font>

46
00:01:59,640 --> 00:02:01,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- He's...
...Goku's...</font>

47
00:02:01,710 --> 00:02:03,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...grandfather?!</font>

48
00:02:03,710 --> 00:02:09,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">D-Don't be stupid!
He died a long time ago!</font>

49
00:02:09,510 --> 00:02:11,550
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Son Gohan did indeed die!</font>

50
00:02:11,550 --> 00:02:17,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But look... there's an angel
halo floating above his head.</font>

51
00:02:17,320 --> 00:02:19,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then why?!</font>

52
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:23,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As I said, this is a battle of destiny!</font>

53
00:02:30,240 --> 00:02:32,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>...</font>

54
00:02:34,440 --> 00:02:37,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>Hang in there, Goku!</i></font>

55
00:02:37,280 --> 00:02:38,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>If you lose now,</i></font>

56
00:02:38,680 --> 00:02:42,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35"><i>it will have been a waste for</i>
<i>him to come all the way here.</i></font>

57
00:02:56,580 --> 00:03:01,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well? You can't do a thing when I
grab your tail, your one weakness!</font>

58
00:03:02,720 --> 00:03:04,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did you hear that? That's his weakness!</font>

59
00:03:04,420 --> 00:03:07,220
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah! We have to tell Pilaf-<i>sama</i>!</font>

60
00:03:11,900 --> 00:03:16,230
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see! So his tail is his weak spot!</font>

61
00:03:17,270 --> 00:03:20,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've done it! I've found
that brat's weakness!</font>

62
00:03:20,960 --> 00:03:24,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His tail is his weakness!</font>

63
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:26,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is excellent news, Pilaf-<i>sama</i>.</font>

64
00:03:26,650 --> 00:03:28,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I was worried what might happen</font>

65
00:03:28,620 --> 00:03:33,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">if that monster boy was
collecting the Dragon Balls again!</font>

66
00:03:37,160 --> 00:03:40,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">The gods haven't
abandoned me after all!</font>

67
00:03:40,730 --> 00:03:46,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">They're telling me to
become ruler of the world!</font>

68
00:03:50,790 --> 00:03:55,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Anyway, the Dragon Ball inside
this special case I designed</font>

69
00:03:55,730 --> 00:03:59,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">won't show up on their radar at all!</font>

70
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:04,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">In other words, that brat can't
get the seventh Dragon Ball!</font>

71
00:04:04,410 --> 00:04:08,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But with our Dragon Radar spy satellite,</font>

72
00:04:08,380 --> 00:04:12,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">his Dragon Balls are ripe for the taking!</font>

73
00:04:12,610 --> 00:04:17,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! Let's go and steal his Dragon Balls!</font>

74
00:04:17,080 --> 00:04:18,880
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sire!</font>

75
00:04:29,360 --> 00:04:34,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That boy's six Dragon Balls
are as good as mine!</font>

76
00:04:34,330 --> 00:04:38,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm not scared of him anymore!</font>

77
00:04:38,000 --> 00:04:41,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">My lifelong dream will come
true this time! Let's go!</font>

78
00:04:41,970 --> 00:04:43,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, sire!</font>

79
00:05:07,500 --> 00:05:10,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well? Do you give up yet?</font>

80
00:05:10,900 --> 00:05:14,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I suggest you just give up...</font>

81
00:05:14,200 --> 00:05:17,240
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">N-Never!</font>

82
00:05:17,240 --> 00:05:20,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What an obstinate boy!</font>

83
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:25,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't you think he's
being a little too violent?!</font>

84
00:05:25,150 --> 00:05:29,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I can't believe an old man
would do something like this!</font>

85
00:05:31,550 --> 00:05:33,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>...</font>

86
00:05:43,940 --> 00:05:45,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow!</font>

87
00:05:45,740 --> 00:05:50,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, no! His tail came off!</font>

88
00:05:52,650 --> 00:05:59,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, my! Now Goku's weakness is gone!</font>

89
00:05:59,490 --> 00:06:00,950
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then that means!</font>

90
00:06:00,950 --> 00:06:02,390
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>!</font>

91
00:06:04,960 --> 00:06:06,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G-Goku!</font>

92
00:06:06,150 --> 00:06:12,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Ow!</font>

93
00:06:13,490 --> 00:06:17,720
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How dare you tear my tail off?!</font>

94
00:06:23,460 --> 00:06:26,490
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now I'm mad!</font>

95
00:06:47,420 --> 00:06:49,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I concede!</font>

96
00:06:49,860 --> 00:06:53,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What was that? Did
you just say you can see?</font>

97
00:06:53,710 --> 00:06:58,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I said I concede defeat. I lose.</font>

98
00:07:00,590 --> 00:07:03,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">D-Did he win?</font>

99
00:07:08,590 --> 00:07:11,060
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I guess there was no avoiding it.</font>

100
00:07:11,060 --> 00:07:13,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku. You've become so strong!</font>

101
00:07:13,770 --> 00:07:16,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You've done well to train this far.</font>

102
00:07:16,030 --> 00:07:18,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-How do you know my name?</font>

103
00:07:18,340 --> 00:07:23,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But it seems you neglected to
toughen up your weak tail, Goku.</font>

104
00:07:23,310 --> 00:07:26,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I warned you about that many a time!</font>

105
00:07:26,310 --> 00:07:29,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You couldn't be!</font>

106
00:07:29,610 --> 00:07:33,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How deplorable that you only realize now.</font>

107
00:07:33,620 --> 00:07:36,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's right. It is I.</font>

108
00:07:36,790 --> 00:07:40,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">G-Grandpa! Grandpa!</font>

109
00:07:40,690 --> 00:07:45,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Grandpa! Grandpa!</font>

110
00:07:46,570 --> 00:07:48,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku!</font>

111
00:07:48,670 --> 00:07:51,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Grandpa! Grandpa!</font>

112
00:07:55,110 --> 00:07:58,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I missed you so much, Grandpa!</font>

113
00:08:01,150 --> 00:08:03,450
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Grandpa!</font>

114
00:08:03,450 --> 00:08:06,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't be foolish.
You're not supposed to cry!</font>

115
00:08:08,790 --> 00:08:12,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, wow! Son-<i>kun</i>'s crying!</font>

116
00:08:12,420 --> 00:08:13,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You can't blame him.</font>

117
00:08:13,690 --> 00:08:17,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">As strong as he is, he's still just a kid.</font>

118
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:20,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i> looks so happy!</font>

119
00:08:20,470 --> 00:08:23,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How is your rear, Goku? Does it still hurt?</font>

120
00:08:23,970 --> 00:08:25,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No...</font>

121
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm sorry for doing that.</font>

122
00:08:26,670 --> 00:08:32,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I wished to admonish you for not
having conquered your weakness,</font>

123
00:08:32,010 --> 00:08:35,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but I inadvertently put a little
too much strength into it.</font>

124
00:08:35,310 --> 00:08:36,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'm fine!</font>

125
00:08:36,980 --> 00:08:40,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see. But you certainly
have become strong.</font>

126
00:08:40,750 --> 00:08:43,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">To think that I would
be no match for you!</font>

127
00:08:43,760 --> 00:08:47,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Did Muten Roshi-<i>sama</i> teach you?</font>

128
00:08:47,430 --> 00:08:48,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah!</font>

129
00:08:51,460 --> 00:08:55,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's a pleasure to see
you again, Roshi-<i>sama</i>!</font>

130
00:08:55,730 --> 00:08:57,370
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, this brings back memories!</font>

131
00:08:57,370 --> 00:09:01,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I had no idea it was you
for a short while there.</font>

132
00:09:01,170 --> 00:09:02,470
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please forgive me.</font>

133
00:09:02,470 --> 00:09:05,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I thought that Goku might hold back
and not fight with his full strength</font>

134
00:09:05,840 --> 00:09:10,250
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">if he realized that it was I
who he was fighting.</font>

135
00:09:10,250 --> 00:09:12,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes, I understand your desire</font>

136
00:09:12,780 --> 00:09:17,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">to see just how far Goku
has actually developed.</font>

137
00:09:17,320 --> 00:09:19,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Um!
- What is it?</font>

138
00:09:19,560 --> 00:09:24,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We heard that Son-<i>kun</i>'s
grandfather was dead, but...</font>

139
00:09:25,430 --> 00:09:28,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Grandpa, you came back to life!</font>

140
00:09:28,570 --> 00:09:31,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, I have not come back to life.</font>

141
00:09:31,700 --> 00:09:34,570
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then how can you be here?
Don't tell me you're a ghost?!</font>

142
00:09:34,570 --> 00:09:37,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Though it looks like you do have legs...</font>

143
00:09:39,580 --> 00:09:42,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I will field that question.</font>

144
00:09:42,780 --> 00:09:47,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I have the ability to go freely from
this world to the next one and back.</font>

145
00:09:47,050 --> 00:09:51,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I scout for dead martial arts
masters in the next world</font>

146
00:09:51,460 --> 00:09:54,890
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">so I can have them fight for me here.</font>

147
00:09:54,890 --> 00:09:57,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">And for a lot of money, I might add!</font>

148
00:09:57,100 --> 00:09:58,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That's the gist of it.</font>

149
00:09:58,660 --> 00:10:01,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Does that mean you
can live with me again?!</font>

150
00:10:01,770 --> 00:10:07,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Unfortunately not. I am only able to
return to this world for a single day.</font>

151
00:10:07,610 --> 00:10:10,740
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then is it just coincidence
that they met today?</font>

152
00:10:10,740 --> 00:10:16,010
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, my sister probably
foresaw us coming here today.</font>

153
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:18,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Exactly.</font>

154
00:10:18,580 --> 00:10:25,590
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Gohan asked me to inform him should
a boy with a tail ever show up.</font>

155
00:10:25,590 --> 00:10:28,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I had no idea it was
his grandson, though...</font>

156
00:10:30,630 --> 00:10:34,730
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't know how he came
to be in your acquaintance,</font>

157
00:10:34,740 --> 00:10:39,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but it's entirely thanks to you that
he has grown this strong, Roshi-<i>sama</i>!</font>

158
00:10:39,940 --> 00:10:42,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you ever so much!</font>

159
00:10:42,510 --> 00:10:46,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, I merely taught him the basics.</font>

160
00:10:46,610 --> 00:10:51,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I, too, am surprised at
how far he has developed!</font>

161
00:10:51,390 --> 00:10:57,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Thank you! Now I can return to
the next world with peace of mind!</font>

162
00:10:58,690 --> 00:11:03,030
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">By the way, does Goku
ever turn into a giant ape?</font>

163
00:11:03,030 --> 00:11:07,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't worry. It's been peaceful
ever since I blew up the moon.</font>

164
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:09,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What're you talking about?!</font>

165
00:11:09,970 --> 00:11:12,170
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, nothing at all!</font>

166
00:11:12,170 --> 00:11:15,610
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, yeah! I have something
good to show you, Grandpa!</font>

167
00:11:15,610 --> 00:11:17,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Something good?</font>

168
00:11:27,920 --> 00:11:29,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here it is!</font>

169
00:11:29,560 --> 00:11:34,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">See, I have the memento you left me!</font>

170
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:37,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If it isn't the ball I found
a long time ago!</font>

171
00:11:37,160 --> 00:11:41,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? Why are there a number
of other balls just like it?!</font>

172
00:11:41,500 --> 00:11:45,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku's life changed thanks to those balls!</font>

173
00:11:45,610 --> 00:11:48,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His life changed?</font>

174
00:11:50,600 --> 00:11:53,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...and there you have it.</font>

175
00:11:53,100 --> 00:11:56,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I see! I hadn't the slightest idea!</font>

176
00:11:56,870 --> 00:12:00,770
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku! You've experienced
many great things!</font>

177
00:12:00,770 --> 00:12:04,510
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">This is great! Now your old man
will come back to life for sure!</font>

178
00:12:04,510 --> 00:12:05,680
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">B-But...</font>

179
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:08,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What's wrong? Aren't you happy?</font>

180
00:12:09,680 --> 00:12:12,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goku-<i>san</i>'s grandfather is dead too,</font>

181
00:12:12,120 --> 00:12:14,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">but we're only bringing
my father back to life...</font>

182
00:12:14,690 --> 00:12:16,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't you worry about me.</font>

183
00:12:16,990 --> 00:12:19,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I've taken quite a liking to the afterlife!</font>

184
00:12:19,560 --> 00:12:22,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Plus, there are plenty of
<i>Pichi-pichi</i> girls there too!</font>

185
00:12:22,660 --> 00:12:24,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">R-Really?!</font>

186
00:12:24,130 --> 00:12:28,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Aha! You still haven't changed your ways!</font>

187
00:12:28,200 --> 00:12:32,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">It's only natural that Muten Roshi-<i>sama</i>'s
best student loves girls too!</font>

188
00:12:32,870 --> 00:12:34,990
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We don't need your smart-aleck remarks!</font>

189
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">T-Thank you!</font>

190
00:12:37,440 --> 00:12:42,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">No, I'm perfectly content seeing as
how Goku is helping other people.</font>

191
00:12:43,880 --> 00:12:49,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now then, seeing as you won, I will
find your object for you, as promised.</font>

192
00:12:49,160 --> 00:12:54,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, my time has come, so I shall
return to the next world now.</font>

193
00:12:54,160 --> 00:12:57,200
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're leaving already, Grandpa?!</font>

194
00:12:57,200 --> 00:12:59,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now that I've seen
how much you've grown</font>

195
00:12:59,970 --> 00:13:05,140
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">and how many great friends
you've made, I needn't worry anymore.</font>

196
00:13:05,140 --> 00:13:07,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Roshi-<i>sama</i>. Friends.</font>

197
00:13:07,310 --> 00:13:12,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Please continue to take care
of this mischievous little boy.</font>

198
00:13:12,080 --> 00:13:14,780
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Baba-<i>sama</i>. Thank you very much.</font>

199
00:13:14,780 --> 00:13:17,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Die in good health again!</font>

200
00:13:17,320 --> 00:13:21,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I look forward to seeing you in the
next world a long time from now,</font>

201
00:13:21,660 --> 00:13:23,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">when you're all grown up!</font>

202
00:13:23,420 --> 00:13:24,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah!</font>

203
00:13:24,660 --> 00:13:29,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well then, someday I'll meet
you all again in the afterlife too.</font>

204
00:13:29,400 --> 00:13:31,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah, in the afterlife...</font>

205
00:13:31,970 --> 00:13:35,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You take care as well.
Or does that also sound odd?</font>

206
00:13:35,440 --> 00:13:36,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Grandpa!</font>

207
00:13:38,670 --> 00:13:43,080
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Grandpa! I'm glad we got to meet!</font>

208
00:13:43,980 --> 00:13:47,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well then, take care, everyone!</font>

209
00:13:48,620 --> 00:13:51,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Goodbye!</font>

210
00:13:51,120 --> 00:13:53,320
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Grandpa!</font>

211
00:13:53,320 --> 00:13:59,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Next time my tail grows, I'm gonna
toughen it up and get even stronger!</font>

212
00:13:59,660 --> 00:14:04,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What will happen to my position
