213
00:14:04,500 --> 00:14:07,300
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Here, I'll find it for you now!</font>

214
00:14:09,540 --> 00:14:12,540
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Twinkle, twinkle, little star,
