215
00:14:12,540 --> 00:14:15,910
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where is the seventh Dragon Ball?!</font>

216
00:14:20,810 --> 00:14:23,050
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let me see...</font>

217
00:14:23,050 --> 00:14:24,980
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh, it's moving...</font>

218
00:14:24,990 --> 00:14:26,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Moving?!</font>

219
00:14:26,790 --> 00:14:34,860
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Can you see it? The Dragon Ball
