221
00:14:40,870 --> 00:14:43,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Where is this car, old lady?!</font>

222
00:14:43,670 --> 00:14:48,710
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Approximately 200 kilometers in
