225
00:14:53,410 --> 00:14:54,800
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Great!</font>

226
00:15:20,700 --> 00:15:24,870
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So the seventh
Dragon Ball's inside that car...</font>

227
00:15:26,540 --> 00:15:32,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Then I'll go find that car and get it!</font>

228
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:35,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Wait! There's no way
you'll find it that easily!</font>

229
00:15:35,920 --> 00:15:39,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There are millions of
