230
00:15:39,120 --> 00:15:41,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There's no need to worry.</font>

231
00:15:41,420 --> 00:15:46,330
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Very few cars go where this one is.</font>

232
00:15:46,330 --> 00:15:49,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But doesn't it seem kind of suspicious?</font>

233
00:15:49,500 --> 00:15:55,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">If the ball's inside the car, then why
