234
00:15:56,770 --> 00:15:59,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Anyway, I'm gonna go now!</font>

235
00:15:59,270 --> 00:16:00,940
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">That way, right?</font>

236
00:16:00,940 --> 00:16:02,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yes...</font>

237
00:16:02,280 --> 00:16:06,410
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! <i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

238
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:14,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hang on to the Dragon Balls for me!</font>

239
00:16:14,790 --> 00:16:16,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I'll be back soon, Upa!</font>

240
00:16:16,620 --> 00:16:17,620
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Right!</font>

241
00:16:17,630 --> 00:16:22,530
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Good for you! We practically
