242
00:16:28,470 --> 00:16:30,630
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's go! <i>Kinto Un</i>!</font>

243
00:16:36,140 --> 00:16:40,270
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Be careful, Goku!</font>

244
00:16:48,120 --> 00:16:53,290
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Who in the world could
