245
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:15,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...and that's the plan! Got it?!</font>

246
00:17:15,020 --> 00:17:19,690
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">- Yes, sire!
- Excellent plan, Pilaf-<i>sama</i>!</font>

247
00:17:19,690 --> 00:17:24,560
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Now that I know his weakness,
there's nothing to be afraid of!</font>

248
00:17:34,340 --> 00:17:39,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">His tail! All I have to do is grab
