<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">For now, um... uh...</font>

254
00:18:01,750 --> 00:18:03,580
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What <i>do</i> I plan to do?</font>

255
00:18:03,580 --> 00:18:06,750
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Eh? What do you plan to do?</font>

256
00:18:06,750 --> 00:18:09,760
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Um, well...</font>

257
00:18:09,760 --> 00:18:12,930
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Tell us, Pilaf-<i>sama</i>!</font>

258
00:18:12,930 --> 00:18:16,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Well, um... Let me think...</font>

259
00:18:16,260 --> 00:18:18,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come on!</font>

260
00:18:18,270 --> 00:18:22,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stop annoying me! It's still a secret!</font>

261
00:18:40,120 --> 00:18:42,820
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There it is! That's the car!</font>

262
00:18:49,460 --> 00:18:52,430
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What was that sound?</font>

263
00:18:52,430 --> 00:18:55,970
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Perhaps a stone hit the roof?</font>

264
00:18:55,970 --> 00:19:00,440
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Can I have your Dragon Ball?!</font>

265
00:19:00,440 --> 00:19:05,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Huh? Haven't I met you
