266
00:19:18,290 --> 00:19:20,460
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-lt's the boy!</font>

267
00:19:20,460 --> 00:19:23,000
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I-lmpossible!</font>

268
00:19:23,000 --> 00:19:25,400
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">W-What's he doing here?!</font>

269
00:19:25,400 --> 00:19:29,070
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Yeah, I'm almost sure
