271
00:19:31,970 --> 00:19:35,840
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">as long as it's inside this case, but!</font>

272
00:19:35,840 --> 00:19:39,350
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Oh! Now I remember!</font>

273
00:19:39,350 --> 00:19:44,150
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You're the guys who tried
to kill me before, aren't you?!</font>

274
00:19:45,020 --> 00:19:47,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What do we do now?</font>

275
00:19:47,020 --> 00:19:49,190
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Our plan was to surprise attack him;</font>

276
00:19:49,190 --> 00:19:52,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">who knew that he would come after <i>us</i>?!</font>

277
00:19:52,260 --> 00:19:54,660
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stay calm!</font>

278
00:19:54,660 --> 00:20:00,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">When you think about it,
it's perfect that he came he alone!</font>

279
00:20:00,100 --> 00:20:04,260
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Once we take care of him,
they're as good as ours!</font>

280
00:20:10,110 --> 00:20:16,520
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Stop worrying! He doesn't
stand a chance against us now!</font>

281
00:20:16,520 --> 00:20:19,380
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Hey! Come out!</font>

282
00:20:41,810 --> 00:20:46,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You did well to figure out where
