284
00:20:49,580 --> 00:20:55,420
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So just hand over that ball quietly!</font>

285
00:20:55,420 --> 00:21:01,920
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Don't be stupid! We're collecting
the Dragon Balls, just like you are!</font>

286
00:21:03,460 --> 00:21:06,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">So what do you say to this?</font>

287
00:21:06,900 --> 00:21:12,100
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">We fight each other.
If you win, you can have this ball.</font>

288
00:21:12,110 --> 00:21:20,280
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">But if we win, we get your six Dragon Balls.</font>

289
00:21:20,280 --> 00:21:23,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">How did you know I have six of them?</font>

290
00:21:25,120 --> 00:21:29,120
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Because I'm a genius!</font>

291
00:21:29,120 --> 00:21:34,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Anyway, can you agree to those terms?!</font>

292
00:21:34,130 --> 00:21:37,960
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Sure! If it's fine by you!</font>

293
00:21:37,970 --> 00:21:40,700
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay! In that case...</font>

294
00:21:40,700 --> 00:21:42,500
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...pinky swear!</font>

295
00:21:43,600 --> 00:21:46,600
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">I don't wanna swear!</font>

296
00:21:48,280 --> 00:21:52,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You idiot! Haven't you ever
heard of a pinky swear?!</font>

297
00:21:52,310 --> 00:21:54,480
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Whatever! Just give me your pinky!</font>

298
00:21:54,480 --> 00:21:59,650
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You'll have to swallow
1,000 needles if you lie!</font>

299
00:22:06,990 --> 00:22:11,160
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">There! Now I feel secure about this!</font>

300
00:22:11,160 --> 00:22:13,130
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Okay, let's fight!</font>

301
00:22:14,700 --> 00:22:17,340
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">You seem to be full of confidence...</font>

302
00:22:17,340 --> 00:22:20,310
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">...but just you wait!</font>

303
00:22:20,310 --> 00:22:21,670
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's go!</font>

304
00:22:26,680 --> 00:22:30,020
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Let's do it!</font>

305
00:22:30,020 --> 00:22:32,180
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">H-Hey! Wait!</font>

306
00:22:34,320 --> 00:22:35,790
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">Come on!</font>

307
00:22:48,270 --> 00:22:50,900
<font face="Avenir Black" size="35">What're these?!</font>

308
00:23:07,190 --> 00:23:10,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33">{\an8}<i>Oide fantaji</i></font>

309
00:23:07,190 --> 00:23:10,090
<font face="Avenir Black" size="33"><i>Come along, fantasy</i></font>

